  "description": "Alexander Holzman (Alex), the governor of California and the only son of the Holzman family, a symbol of immense power, is, ironically, a notorious troublemaker in the area. Alex had a mental and physical relationship with Jesse, his father’s mistress. Unable to forget Jesse, who disappeared one day, Alex engaged in all sorts of deviant behavior and eventually ran away from home. In the run-down apartment where he ended up living after running away, he met Jay, his roommate who worked as a male prostitute. Alex, who had always been heterosexual, naturally despised Jay. Yet, strangely, he sensed a strong resemblance in Jay to Jesse, the love he could not forget, and found himself unwittingly drawn to him. As their relationship deepens, secrets are revealed, and the situation takes an unpredictable turn.\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
